  "@invoiceNumberPending": {
    "description": "Stands where an invoice number would be, for a draft that does not have one yet (D-048). A number is allocated on issue, so that abandoning a draft does not consume one permanently. Deliberately short: it occupies a fixed-width table column, and it is also the heading of a card. Deliberately NOT a repeat of statusDraft -- the status badge sits beside it in all three layouts and already says the invoice is a draft, so this says only the thing the badge does not. Deliberately not blank: an empty cell reads as data that failed to load."
